S121's four parts, as one throwaway patch over the phase 1 landing (the
table at identity). Never committed to src/ in this form (DEC-326 (7)); the
screen, the cost run and the candidate's paste apply it, and a landing folds
it. `git apply` reads from the first `---` line on, so this text is ignored.

  S121_PARTS  build-time mask, 0 when unset: 1 P1 enemy pawn attacks dropped,
              2 P2a the mobility area in place of "not an own piece" with own
              blocked pawns dropped, 8 P2b own low-rank pawns dropped as well
              (only with bit 2), 4 P3 the pin rule. 0 is the phase 1 landing
              node for node.
  S121_COST   the cost-only form of the same mask (DEC-047): the parts it
              names computed and handed to an asm barrier, the score
              S121_PARTS's, which must then be 0.

